#==============================================================================================
#
#   grid_formatting_context_3 - Layout::GridFormattingContext: initializing track sizes and
#                               resolving intrinsic track sizes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/GridFormattingContext.cpp (lines 661-1121): steps 1 and 2 of the
#       track sizing algorithm (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-2/#algo-init,
#       https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-2/#algo-content): each track's base size and growth
#       limit, then the items' contributions, single-track items first, then spanning items
#       by span size, distributing extra space across the spanned tracks' base sizes and
#       growth limits, and items crossing flexible tracks.
#
#       The C++ templates' `Match matcher` lambdas are ak.Function1 predicates over a track
#       whose context is the available size they capture.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2023-2025, Aliaksandr Kalenik <kalenik.aliaksandr@gmail.com>
#       Copyright (c) 2022-2023, Martin Falisse <mfalisse@outlook.com>
